Volume [SimTalk] - Tank
Sets the Volume, i.e., the amount of the ingredient, which the Tank designated by <Path> can hold.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Volume:real
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type real.
Example
MyTank.Volume := 10
See also
