Exceeded [SimTalk]
Sets if the sensor is to be triggered if the amount of material in the Tank designated by <Path> has
Exceeded, i.e., is located above the sensor position (true) or not (false).
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Sensors.ID<Number>.Exceeded:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
MyTank.Sensors.id1.Exceeded := true
if Exceeded = true then
   ?.EntranceLocked := true
end
See also
Exceeded [check box]
Exceeded [SimTalk]
